            "sid": "EZR 2:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chu ko che kitogosta eng’ Tel-mela, Tel-harsa, Kerub, Adan, ak Imer: ago kima imuch kobor gorikab kwanisiekwak, ak iyotenywa, ngo ki bo Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lagokab Delaia, lagokab Tobia, lagokab Nekoda, ko kiek bogol lo ak konom ak aeng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.60"
            ]
          }
        },
