        {
          "text": "Ak kingobwa gotab Jehovah ne mi Jerusalem, kandoikab gorikab kwanisiek, kogoito tuguk eng’ chamnyet, keteege gotab Kamuktaindet eng’ ole kimi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
